From 52406c2b9313c7d0a1a62c9050b5428d1836b91d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:26:42 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-PROF-001 wave 16: open existing profile directories in
 place

Expose an additive directory-token API so a host can assign existing Default data to a shell profile without moving live databases. Validate exact disk spelling and reject symlinks asynchronously, preserve startup lifetime, coalesce initialized contexts and retain create-if-missing behavior under concurrent opens. Preserve ABI 1.10 layouts and advertise profile_directory in ABI 1.13.

Last rebased: 2026-11-03 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
